/testnet
# No exceptions (audit v3, OPS-1). `deploy/*.key.json` and `deploy/payout/*.key.json` were
# whitelisted here and tracked in a PUBLIC repository, so chains 8–13 all ran on validator seeds
# and payout spend keys anyone could read. Chain 14's keys are generated off-repo by
# deploy/gen-chain14-keys.sh into $KEYDIR and never enter the tree; deploy/lib/key-guard.sh
# refuses a cut that names a key inside it.
*.key.json
.git-rev
bin-b00bc72/
bin-03c9fb9/
bin-*/
.worktrees/
# A wallet's note store holds every note plaintext, nullifier and leaf index it knows, and a
# wallets/ directory holds spend keys: neither belongs in a public repository. Nor do node A's
# log or a crate-local build directory.
/wallets/
*.notes.json
*.notes.json.*
/run-a.log
**/target/
# The prover feasibility spike's build output: several GB per target directory.
/spikes/*/target*/
/spikes/*/pkg*/
